{"ticker":"MSCI","updated":"2026-10-23T23:19:33Z","profile":{"longName":"MSCI Inc.","shortName":"MSCI Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Financial Data & Stock Exchanges","country":"United States","website":"https://www.msci.com","fullTimeEmployees":6259,"marketCap":44755574784,"trailingPE":31.73299,"forwardPE":27.491823,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":13.039305,"pegRatio":1.9,"targetMeanPrice":681.4706,"targetHighPrice":735.0,"targetLowPrice":550.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.124,"earningsGrowth":0.144,"grossMargins":0.8289,"operatingMargins":0.56413,"profitMargins":0.40313998,"totalRevenue":3432358912,"beta":1.237,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":644.77,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":501.08,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.32},"summary":"MSCI Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides research-based data, analytics, and indexes, supported by advanced technology worldwide. The Index segment provides indexes for use in various areas of the investment process, including indexed financial products, such as ETFs, mutual funds, annuities, futures, options, structured products, and over-the-counter derivatives; performance benchmarking; portfolio construction and rebalancing; and asset allocation, as well as licenses GICS and GICS Direct. The Analytics segment offers risk management, performance attribution and portfolio management content, application, an integrated view of risk and return service, and an analysis of market, credit, liquidity, counterparty, and climate risk across asset classes; managed services, including consolidation of client portfolio data, review and reconciliation of input data and results, and customized reporting; and HedgePlatform to measure, evaluate, and monitor the risk of hedge fund investments. The Sustainability and Climate segment provides products and services that help institutional investors understand how ESG impacts the long-term risk and return of their portfolio and individual security-level investments; and data, ratings, research, and tools to assist investors navigate increasing regulation. The All Other  Private Assets segment comprises private credit, real estate and","summary_zh":"MSCI Inc. 及其子公司在全球先進技術的支援下提供基於研究的數據、分析和指數。指數部門提供用於投資過程各個領域的指數，包括指數金融產品，如ETF、共同基金、年金、期貨、選擇權、結構性產品和場外衍生性商品；績效基準測試；投資組合建構和再平衡；和資產配置，以及 GICS 和 GICS Direct 授權。分析部門提供風險管理、績效歸因和投資組合管理內容、應用程式、風險和回報服務的綜合視圖，以及跨資產類別的市場、信用、流動性、交易對手和氣候風險的分析；託管服務，包括整合客戶組合數據、審查和核對輸入數據和結果以及定制報告； HedgePlatform 用於衡量、評估和監控對沖基金的風險監控。永續發展和氣候部門提供產品和服務，幫助機構投資者了解 ESG 如何影響其投資組合和個人安全等級投資的長期風險和回報；以及幫助投資者應對日益嚴格的監管的數據、評級、研究和工具。所有其他 私人資產部門包括私人信貸、房地產和","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"財務數據和證券交易所","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":573.46,"h":577.45,"l":569.93,"c":573.72,"v":532500},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":572.88,"h":572.91,"l":562.93,"c":571.43,"v":425100},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":571.49,"h":575.27,"l":569.71,"c":570.15,"v":332900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":571.05,"h":572.13,"l":568.39,"c":568.55,"v":521500},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":568.8,"h":571.64,"l":565.53,"c":567.72,"v":499000},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":560.66,"h":565.79,"l":548.0,"c":553.91,"v":845300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":552.6,"h":558.44,"l":549.09,"c":551.61,"v":898700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":554.1,"h":557.6,"l":551.0,"c":557.19,"v":590600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":558.36,"h":561.59,"l":554.0,"c":555.15,"v":626800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":557.73,"h":576.16,"l":554.91,"c":574.58,"v":922800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":571.99,"h":574.5,"l":567.9,"c":569.16,"v":671200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":571.77,"h":571.77,"l":558.98,"c":563.18,"v":648700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":565.71,"h":585.84,"l":564.8,"c":585.48,"v":477000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":584.07,"h":585.45,"l":576.34,"c":583.25,"v":722100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":584.15,"h":584.34,"l":574.95,"c":576.61,"v":1255800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":576.15,"h":580.04,"l":562.9,"c":567.02,"v":566600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":568.81,"h":585.4,"l":568.81,"c":578.64,"v":875400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":579.31,"h":579.99,"l":