"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1408198/000140819826000011/msci-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Our research-based data, analytics and indexes, supported by advanced technology, set standards for global investors and help our clients understand risks and opportunities, make better investment decisions and unlock innovation.","zh":"我們以研究為基礎的數據、分析和指數，在先進技術的支持下，為全球投資者設定標準，幫助我們的客戶了解風險和機遇，做出更好的投資決策並釋放創新。"},{"en":"Investors all over the world use our tools and solutions to gain insights and improve transparency throughout their investment processes. Our offerings help them define their investment universe; make asset allocation decisions; construct and analyze portfolios and investment strategies; identify, measure and manage drivers of investment risk and performance; integrate sustainability and climate considerations into portfolio construction and risk management; design and manage indexed financial products such as exchange-traded funds (\"ETFs\"); and prepare regulatory and client reports.","zh":"世界各地的投資者使用我們的工具和解決方案來獲取見解並提高整個投資流程的透明度。我們的產品幫助他們定義自己的投資範圍；做出資產配置決策；建立和分析投資組合和投資策略；識別、衡量和管理投資風險和績效的驅動因素；將永續性和氣候因素納入投資組合建構和風險管理；設計和管理指數化金融產品，例如交易所交易基金（「ETF」）；並準備監管和客戶報告。"},{"en":"Our products and services include indexes; portfolio construction and risk management analytical models and tools; sustainability and climate solutions; and private asset data and analytics. We are focused on supporting investors' total portfolio needs across asset classes through our integrated solutions. We use advanced technology, including artificial intelligence (\"AI\"), to improve how we collect and validate data and enhance the capabilities and insights we deliver to clients.","zh":"我們的產品和服務包括指數；投資組合建構和風險管理分析模型和工具；永續性和氣候解決方案；以及私人資產數據和分析。我們致力於透過我們的整合解決方案支援投資者跨資產類別的整體投資組合需求。我們使用包括人工智慧（“AI”）在內的先進技術來改進我們收集和驗證數據的方式，並增強我們為客戶提供的能力和見解。"}],"markets":[{"en":"For the year ended December 31, 2025, we had the following five operating segments: Index, Analytics, Sustainability and Climate, Real Assets and Private Capital Solutions, which are presented as the following three reportable segments: Index, Analytics, and Sustainability and Climate. For reporting purposes, the Real Assets and Private Capital Solutions operating segments are combined and presented as All Other – Private Assets, as they did not meet the required thresholds for separate reportable segment disclosure. In the first quarter of 2025 we retitled our \"ESG and Climate\" operating and reportable segment as \"Sustainability and Climate\" to reflect the breadth of our product offerings. The change did not affect the composition of our operating or reportable segments or our historical segment results.","zh":"截至2025年12月31日的年度，我們有以下五個營運部門：指數、分析、永續發展和氣候、實體資產和私人資本解決方案，並以以下三個可報告部門呈現：指數、分析、永續發展和氣候。出於報告目的，實體資產和私人資本解決方案業務部門被合併並呈報為“所有其他 - 私人資產”，因為它們不符合單獨報告分部披露所需的門檻。 2025 年第一季度，我們將“ESG 和氣候”營運和報告部門重新命名為“永續發展和氣候”，以反映我們產品供應的廣度。這項變更不會影響我們的營運或可報告分部的組成或我們的歷史分部業績。"},{"en":"Clients use our indexes to support many areas of the investment process, including for developing indexed financial products (e.g., ETFs, mutual funds, annuities, futures, options, structured products, over-the-counter derivatives), performance benchmarking, portfolio construction and rebalancing, asset allocation, and creating custom indexes. Our index families span multiple asset classes, geographies and investment strategies. Clients can access our index data directly from MSCI or through third-party vendors worldwide.","zh":"客戶使用我們的指數來支援投資流程的許多領域，包括開發指數金融產品（例如 ETF、共同基金、年金、期貨、選擇權、結構性產品、場外衍生性商品）、績效基準測試、投資組合建構和再平衡、資產配置以及創建自訂指數。我們的指數系列涵蓋多個資產類別、地理和投資策略。客戶可以直接從 MSCI 或透過全球第三方供應商存取我們的指數資料。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Index. Many industry participants compete with us by offering one or more indexes in similar categories. Such indexes vary widely in scope, including by geographic region, business sector and weighting methodology, and may be used by clients in a variety of ways in many different markets around the world. Among our Index competitors are S&P Dow Jones Indices LLC (a joint venture of S&P Global Inc. and CME Group Inc.); FTSE Russell, a subsidiary of the London Stock Exchange Group plc; Nasdaq Inc; Bloomberg Finance L.P. (\"Bloomberg\"); and Solactive AG.","zh":"指數。許多行業參與者透過提供一個或多個類似類別的指數來與我們競爭。此類指數的範圍差異很大，包括地理區域、業務部門和加權方法，並且客戶可以在全球許多不同市場以多種方式使用。我們的指數競爭對手包括 S&P Dow Jones Indices LLC（S&P Global Inc. 和 CME Group Inc. 的合資企業）；富時羅素，倫敦證券交易所集團的子公司；納斯達克公司；彭博財經有限責任公司（「彭博」）；和 Solactive AG。"},{"en":"Competition also exists from industry participants, including asset managers and investment banks, that create their own indexes, often in cooperation with index providers who provide some form of calculation agent service. Some asset managers also manage funds, including ETFs, based on their proprietary indexes, and some investment banks launch structured products or create over-the-counter derivatives based on their proprietary indexes. This is often referred to as self-indexing.","zh":"行業參與者（包括資產管理公司和投資銀行）也存在競爭，他們創建自己的指數，通常與提供某種形式的計算代理服務的指數提供者合作。一些資產管理公司也根據其專有指數管理包括ETF在內的基金，一些投資銀行根據其專有指數推出結構性產品或創建場外衍生性商品。這通常稱為自索引。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Reportable Segment Aggregation Before Other Operating","val":2855120000,"zh":"其他經營分部之前的可報告分部總結"},{"name":"Index","val":1786808000,"zh":"指數部門"},{"name":"Analytics","val":714397000,"zh":"分析部門"},{"name":"Sustainability & Climate","val":353915000,"zh":"永續發展與氣候部門"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":279339000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":3134459000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Recurring Subscriptions","val":2278704000,"zh":"定期訂閱"},{"name":"Asset Based Fees","val":770670000,"zh":"基於資產的費用"},{"name":"Non Recurring","val":85085000,"zh":"非經常性"}],"total":3134459000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":1408108000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":1267406000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":1241979000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Other Europe Middle East & Africa Countries","val":698498000,"zh":"其他歐洲、中東和非洲國家"},{"name":"GB","val":543481000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"Asia & Australia","val":484372000,"zh":"亞洲和澳大利亞"},{"name":"Other Asia & Australia Countries","val":356761000,"zh":"其他亞洲和澳洲國家"},{"name":"Other America Countries","val":140702000,"zh":"其他美洲國家"},{"name":"JP","val":127611000,"zh":"日本"}],"total":3134459000}},"peers":["SPGI","MCO","MKTX","FICO","VRSK"]}}